# WP-ENTITY-REFS (UE 5.5: a soft actor reference to an actor of another cell resolves while that actor is loaded; hard
# references - a Blueprint's included, FWorldPartitionActorDesc::GetReferences - join the actors into one cluster,
# FActorClusterContext). One resolver, Rules::ResolveEntityReferences: the register's component fields, a script's
# Entity properties (Property.Entity() soft = Observation, Property.Entity({ hard = true }) = Containment) and names
# (kEntityReferencesByName). Residency lists Rebound / Unbound pairs; WorldStreamer publishes them to ScriptSystem
# (ECS::EntityReferenceBindings), which writes the property into the running script again (entity / nil).
# Expected log lines (editor.log "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': ..."):
#   "rebound 1 reference into G0L0(<x>,<z>)"   (the beacon's cell, as DescribeResidencyUnit spells it)
#   "unbound 1 reference from G0L0(<x>,<z>); they read nil until it returns"
# CONTENT (Content/Scripts/World): RefTurret.lua -
#   Properties = { Target = Property.Entity( { tooltip = "What the turret tracks." } ) }
#   function OnUpdate(dt) if Properties.Target and Properties.Target:valid() then <yaw self toward Target's position> end end
# and Scripts/World/RefHardLink.lua - Properties = { Part = Property.Entity( { hard = true } ) }.
# Ids: turret 9200001 (cell A, by the Player), beacon 9200002 (cell B, ~2 cells along +X), hard pair 9200003 -> 9200004
# (neighbouring cells). LEAD: if `set ... ScriptComponent...` is not the DesertCtl form on this build, attach the scripts in
# Details > Add Component > Script and pick the targets in the Entity field (as GDT-1 does for its demo script).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 1000,0,1000 --id 9200001
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 27000,0,1000 --id 9200002
Дано add-component 9200001 Script
Дано set 9200001 Script.Scripts '[{"ScriptKey":"assets:Scripts/World/RefTurret.lua","Props":[{"Name":"Target","Type":7,"Ref":9200002}]}]'
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Тогда refs_deferred турель у игрока стоит в исходном повороте (маяк в ячейке B не загружен, Target = nil); в логе "reference(s) from records just activated name an entity that is not resident"
# 30 m up: at 6 m the camera stood under the terrain (refs_rebound 11-19 showed its underside).
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 26000,3000,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.23,-0.69,0.69
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда refs_rebound маяк в ячейке B на месте; турель повернулась на маяк; лог: "rebound 1 reference into G0L0(…)" (ячейка маяка)
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,600,-500
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Когда run Action "Stop"
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 12700,0,1000 --id 9200003
Дано spawn Content/Meshes/Modeling/Box.stmesh 12900,0,1000 --id 9200004
Когда add-component 9200003 Script
Когда set 9200003 Script.Scripts '[{"ScriptKey":"assets:Scripts/World/RefHardLink.lua","Props":[{"Name":"Part","Type":7,"Ref":9200004}]}]'
Когда run Scene "World Partition: Refresh"
# The cluster is read off each entity's Details > World Partition > Cell (the WP map is drawn in Play only).
Когда select 9200003
Тогда refs_cluster_a Details 9200003: World Partition > Cell - одна ячейка с 9200004 (кадр refs_cluster_b), хотя они по разные стороны границы ячейки
Когда select 9200004
Тогда refs_cluster_b Details 9200004: World Partition > Cell - та же, что у 9200003 в refs_cluster_a - кластер по жёсткой EntityRef скрипта
